  "notes": "{侮蔑|ぶべつ} is a formal word expressing contempt or disdain.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {侮蔑|ぶべつ}する: to despise, to scorn (suru-verb)\n- {侮蔑|ぶべつ}の{目|め}: contemptuous eyes\n- {侮蔑|ぶべつ}{的|てき}: contemptuous, disdainful\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal and literary; commonly used in writing.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {蔑|さげす}む: to despise (verb)\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}: contempt, scorn (more common)\n- {見下|みくだ}す: to look down on\n- {蔑視|べっし}: disdain, contempt",
